        [9, 'easy', 'In a company production report, Year 1 output was 200 units and Year 2 output was 400 units. What is the percentage increase in output?', '100.0%', '105.0%', '97.0%', '110.0%', 'A', 'Percentage Increase = ((Year 2 - Year 1) / Year 1) * 100 = ((400 - 200) / 200) * 100 = 100.0%.', 40, 'General Practice', 0, NULL],
